## 2. Category mapping: v3's 76 labels → MAPLEZ's 12

Freeze this mapping in a YAML **before** any prediction is scored. A label counts toward a
category if it is `Present` under any label mapped to that category. Location strings are
unioned across those labels.

| MAPLEZ | v3 labels (plus Unlisted matched by name) | Tier |
|---|---|---|
| cardiomegaly | Enlarged Heart (Cardiomegaly) | **clean** |
| pleural effusion | Pleural Effusion, Loculated Effusion | **clean** |
| pneumothorax | Pneumothorax | **clean** |
| consolidation | Consolidation (Pneumonia) | **clean** |
| lung edema | Edema (strict) · Edema ∪ Congestion (broad). Report both | clean / partial |
| atelectasis | Linear Atelectasis, Lobar Collapse, Unlisted *atelectasis* | partial |
| fracture | Abnormal rib, Spinal Compression Fracture, Unlisted *fracture* | partial |
| lung lesion | Nodule, Unremarkable/Remarkable Nodules, Mass (Lung Mass), Pulmonary Cavity, Abscess | partial |
| support device | all of `devices_surgical` that are lines, tubes or devices, plus Unlisted PICC / Tracheostomy | partial |
| pleural other | Unremarkable/Remarkable Pleural Thickening, Pleural Plaque, Pleural Adhesion, Indeterminate Pleural/Fissural Thickening | partial |
| lung opacity, enlarged cardiomediastinum | *(super-categories with no v3 equivalent)* | **descriptive only, no headline number** |

**Headline numbers come from the four clean categories.** Partial categories are reported, but
their presence F1 measures the mapping as much as the teacher.

